  <name>inkpage</name>
  <summary>Simple PDF editor</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      inkpage is a simple PDF editor for Linux, based on PDF4QT by Jakub Melka.
      It edits annotations, page content and pages of PDF documents.
    </p>
    <p>
      The text of scanned documents is recognized with Tesseract (OCR) and
      written as an invisible, searchable text layer.
    </p>
  </description>
